incorrect expectation json format for:

  {
    "httpRequest" : {
      "body" : {
        "type" : "JSON",
        "json" : [
          {
            "context" : [
              {
                "source" : "DECISION_REQUEST"
              },
              {
                "source" : "DECISION_REQUEST"
              },
              {
                "source" : "DECISION_REQUEST"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }

 schema validation errors:

  22 errors:
   - $.binaryResponse: is missing but it is required
   - $.dnsResponse: is missing but it is required
   - $.grpcBidiResponse: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type GrpcBidiResponse
   - $.grpcStreamResponse: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type GrpcStreamResponse
